" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Aurícula izquierda&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>1</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Aurícula&lt;br&gt;izquierda&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="333" y="146" w="73" h="33"/></label><label labelid="7" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="24" y="240"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>93</x><y>0</y></point></points><origin><x>101</x><y>258</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Ventrículo derecho&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>1</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Ventrículo&lt;br&gt;derecho&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="14" y="241" w="87" h="33"/></label><label labelid="8" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="336" y="236"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-64</x><y>0</y></point></points><origin><x>332</x><y>254</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Ventrículo izquierdo&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>1</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Ventrículo&lt;br&gt;izquierdo&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="332" y="237" w="87" h="33"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Ciclo cardiaco&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" slideid="2" sequence="2"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Al principio de la diástole la sangre entra en las aurículas. La sangre llega a la aurícula derecha por la vena cava superior y la vena cava inferior. Al mismo tiempo, la sangre llega a la aurícula izquierda por las cuatro venas pulmonares.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Diástole inicial&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>001707f8_2.swf</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="16" y="37"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>54</x><y>48</y></point></points><origin><x>91</x><y>55</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Vena cava superior&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>2</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Vena cava&lt;br&gt;superior&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="6" y="38" w="85" h="33"/></label><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="25" y="310"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>49</x><y>-43</y></point></points><origin><x>100</x><y>328</y></origin